Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这是要干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did we all go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,安静 孩子 站着别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, kid, stand still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚还在别的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just somewhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.81,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么来到这里的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要装白痴 否则我要给你妈妈打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quit acting like some damn retard, or I'll call your mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她你调皮捣蛋得不得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell her what a naughty little shit you've been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,凯丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayleigh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,凯丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayleigh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是 结果是阴性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The good news is the results are negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何机能障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found no evidence of lesions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,颅腔出血以及肿瘤的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}haemorrhaging, tumours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一定可以查出原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you must have something you can go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,按我的猜想 失忆和精神压力有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was to guess, I'd say the blackouts are stress related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可他才七岁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's seven years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.60,0:08:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,七岁的孩子会有什么精神压力啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of stress can a seven-year-old have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很多 比如说没有父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plenty. Maybe he has severe coping problems{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也会造成他有这种问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}about not having a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你说上次失忆时是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said the last time the blackouts occurred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.32,0:08:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,跟朋友的爸爸在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was visiting his friend's dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直催我要见父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he has been pushing me to meet his father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我却一直拖着 - 值得一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and I've been putting it off. - It's worth a shot, Andrea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以安排一个限制性的会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can arrange a controlled meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,给詹森适量的镇静剂 多派一些保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A careful dose of sedatives for Jason, some security,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,跟埃文短暂地会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan comes in for a quick visit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,幸许埃文思念父亲的情节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and with a little luck,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也会随之消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}no more missing father complex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"四月十五号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"April 15th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,今天要见爸爸啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today I get to meet my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫詹森 他是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Jason and he's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望他能让我管他叫爸爸"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope he lets me call him Dad."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:19.29,Default,,0,0,8,,(桑尼威尔协会  精神病院)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸住在这里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Dad lives here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在我们现在所在的这一栋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in this wing, actually, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你见他有点困\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if your dad seems a little sleepy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为吃了药 知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's because of the medicine, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一会儿就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll just be a moment, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我不会咬你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. I won't bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你看过我的照片吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen pictures of me, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈说我笑起来像你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh. Mum says I have your smile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,头发也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了你 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will kill you... - Nooo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他必须死 这是唯一的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has to die! It's the only way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,詹森 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了 没有事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be okay. It's gonna be alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他伤的很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hurt bad. Get a stretcher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.34,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把他拖出去 - 真对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, let's get him out of here. - I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在生生不息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In sure and certain hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,永恒重生的生命中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the resurrection to eternal life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.74,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,吾等将詹森兄弟交予万能的上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}we commend to almighty God, our brother Jason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,愿主赐福并接纳他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lord bless him and keep him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,愿主的光芒照耀着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Lord make his face to shine upon him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,愿主的宽厚仁慈泽被于他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and be gracious unto him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,愿主赐予他永恒的安息 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and give him peace. Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:26.74,Default,,0,0,8,,(六年之后)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哪去了？它一定在这附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, where is it? Damn, I know it's down here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,汤米 烦死了 好了没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy, I'm bored shitless over here. What's up already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊你到底在找什么呀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what are you looking for, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, lard arse. And you, hold your fucking horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一定就在这附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果让爸爸抓到我们在这里抽烟 我们就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If dad catches us smoking down here, we're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸有个雷管在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew Dad had a blockbuster down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去找个东西来炸个过瘾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's blow the shit out of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.91,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 看你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,做梦去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No freaking way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可不想碰这种东西 - 你敢不弄试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not touching this thing. - The hell you aren't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要是让别人干的话 你这孬种会去告状的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of us does it and you're gonna puss out and nark for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这回不行 你看引信这么短\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't gonna work this time, buddy. Look how small this fuse is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会被炸死的 - 不见得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll get killed. - Not necessarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这样至少多出个两分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should buy you two minutes at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.85,0:12:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee thanks, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 兰尼 你个笨蛋 只管干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, for Christ's sake, Lenny, you moron, just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 有种兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - You got balls, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,够慢的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit took you long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.41,0:13:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么搞？快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell? Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文 快帮我把他扶起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan, come on. Help me get him up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文 转回身 帮我扶他起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan, get your arse back here and help me get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？这是哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened? Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊我们都做了些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God. What did we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文 快来帮我一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan, come on. Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊怎么会这样呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God, how could we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点我们走 - 兰尼你怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, let's go! - Shit, Lenny, what happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.01,0:13:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fine. He's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:13:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,过一会儿都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么了？为啥不说话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with him? Why isn't he speaking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,惊吓过度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in shock, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么啦？发生了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在树林里生火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were just in the woods building a fort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,兰尼突然发作 本来好好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}when Lenny freaked out. One minute he was okay,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.49,0:14:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,忽然就一动不动了 是这样的吧 伙计？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then he just froze up. Right, guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么？埃文 告诉我真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened, Evan? The truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我记不得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有事情发生了 一定有什么事导致这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something must have happened. Something set him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的一片空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I blacked it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.83,0:14:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这回你别想再拿你的失忆蒙混过关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try to use your blackouts to get out of this one.{\r}
