Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.11,0:40:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What... what did he do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.98,0:40:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,忘了它吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.15,0:40:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有过 他那时候已经病得很重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing. He was far too sick by then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.62,0:40:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？告诉我到底怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mum, what did he say that he could do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.67,0:40:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他就像个傻子一样说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say, as a goof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.88,0:40:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mum, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.38,0:40:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙蔽自己蛮有趣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, yourself... it'll be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你说了算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, it's your dime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.27,0:40:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我 年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.98,0:40:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这肯定是什么把戏 - 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is supposed to be your trick. - Uh-uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.15,0:40:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾文 - 什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Evan! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.20,0:40:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你原来看过手相吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever had your palm read before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.20,0:40:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 这是第一次 请温柔一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, this is the first time, so be gentle please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.66,0:41:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.37,0:41:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有生命线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no lifeline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不属于这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't belong here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.34,0:41:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,花五块钱就是为了喷你一脸唾沫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For an extra five bucks she'll spit in your face, Mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.17,0:41:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不真的他的将来会怎么样？- 他没有灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, really, what's his future? - He has no soul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.55,0:41:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就不该来到这个世上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were never meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.64,0:41:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,精神打击 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psychic, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.65,0:41:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不感到奇怪吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This won't come as much of a shock to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.07,0:41:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.00,0:41:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候又开始抽烟了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you start smoking again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.25,0:41:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别管我了 埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lay off, Evan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.59,0:41:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.30,0:41:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.39,0:42:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会让这个老巫婆败坏一天的兴致吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna let that old hag ruin the rest of our time together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.06,0:42:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她在胡说八道 跟疯子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's nuts, she's a lunatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.94,0:42:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就像在演戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's like an act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.65,0:42:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们这么做是为了... - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They just do that... - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.56,0:42:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她说到了生你的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, she just hit a nerve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.99,0:42:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.53,0:42:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我搞不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.08,0:42:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在你出生之前 我怀孕过二次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you were born, I was pregnant twice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.91,0:42:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,都流产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they were both stillbirths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.46,0:42:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没告诉过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you ever tell me that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.80,0:42:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是我不想记得的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not something I like to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.64,0:42:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当我怀了你的时候 我怕极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then when I was pregnant with you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.77,0:42:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须考虑到最坏的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was terrified. I had to expect the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.22,0:43:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？- 然后你的出生很顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And? - And you came out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.59,0:43:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,从那个时候开始 我总认为你是我的奇迹小宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ever since then, I've considered you my little miracle baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.33,0:43:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不要哭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.13,0:43:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧 很晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go. It's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.43,0:43:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"反正我不想参加那部电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I never wanted to be in the movie, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.15,0:43:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天有些冷 因此我想穿上衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was cold, so I wanted to wear my clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.27,0:43:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可是米勒先生却把我的衬衫脱掉了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Miller took my shirt off."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.36,0:43:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的在做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.36,0:43:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 做这个时 我需要安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shhh, I need quiet for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.03,0:43:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你傻了还是怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you stupid or what, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.66,0:43:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你拼命压抑整洁外表下占据着你内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe there's a reason you repressed the day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.45,0:43:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,的变态心理 也许是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}some pervert had you in your tighty whities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.04,0:43:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你做的事我想过两遍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd think twice about what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.08,0:43:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,醒来或许情况会更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could wake up a lot more fucked up than you are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.63,0:44:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在我已经搞得够糟了 - 不我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- More fucked up than I already am? - No, l...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.21,0:44:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你了解我？连我自己都不了解我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you know me? I don't know me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.42,0:44:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.67,0:44:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.55,0:44:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.72,0:44:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,到他妈该死的哪一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we get through one damn day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.01,0:44:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你才能不打碎点东西呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}without you breaking something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.43,0:45:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.21,0:45:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.47,0:45:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊多长时间没见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God. It's been a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.00,0:45:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.60,0:45:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,老样子 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same old, same old, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.19,0:45:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不知道 说说你的近况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't know. Fill me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.15,0:45:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhh, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.11,0:45:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我上了州立大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to State now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.57,0:45:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都还不错 我妈妈也很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going good. My Mum's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.07,0:45:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这样吧 - 抽烟吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - You want a smoke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.33,0:45:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不了大了就不抽了 - 真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, not since we were kids. - No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.79,0:45:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经戒了上百次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've quit like 100 times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.58,0:46:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你准备走着回家？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you walking home? - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.87,0:46:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能送你一程吗？- 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I walk you? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.84,0:46:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真难以相信 - 还有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh my God. - So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.97,0:46:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,汤米还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}how's Tommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.12,0:46:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在少年监狱里关了几年 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they kept him in juvie for a few years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.39,0:46:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 他在Dale汽修厂工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now he's working over at Dale's Auto Body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.40,0:46:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.86,0:46:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在还一直与你父亲生活在一起？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still living with your dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.03,0:46:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.24,0:46:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我从十五岁开始便自己谋生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I emancipated myself at 15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.19,0:46:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这需要很多勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must've taken a lot of courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.08,0:46:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果记得我爸就不会这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you remember my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.56,0:46:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么不搬去与你妈妈一起住呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, couldn't you have just moved in with your mum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.84,0:46:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,现在她有了新家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she had a new family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.80,0:46:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,住不下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't enough room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,随便啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.59,0:46:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这次回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well look, the reason I came back to town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.43,0:46:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就是想与你谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}was to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.34,0:47:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,与我？为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To me? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.54,0:47:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.61,0:47:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,记得小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}remember when we were kids{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.98,0:47:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我经常失忆吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I used to have those blackouts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.74,0:47:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.65,0:47:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有些记忆我又想起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, some of those memories have been coming back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.62,0:47:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想跟你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I just... I wanted to talk to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.33,0:47:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一件很特别的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}about one of them in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.54,0:47:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我会试着回忆下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll try to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.31,0:47:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们小时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we were kids, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.34,0:47:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸正在拍电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}your dad was making a movie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.59,0:47:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是关于罗宾汉什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}about Robin Hood... something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.72,0:47:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道什么？埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want to know, Evan?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.06,0:47:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他... 有没有...？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is... did he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.48,0:47:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在地下室到底发生了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened in the basement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.56,0:47:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 那是很久以前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it was a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.40,0:47:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.40,0:47:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你为什么大老远跑回来的原因？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you came all the way back here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.91,0:47:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,问一大堆关于罗宾汉的愚蠢问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To ask a lot of stupid questions about Robin Hood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.83,0:48:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, l...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.41,0:48:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得可能发生了一些非常不好的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just think that something really bad might have happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.83,0:48:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你问这有什么目的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a point to any of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.29,0:48:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不管发生了什么事情 都不是我们的过错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, whatever happened it wasn't our fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是小孩 我们无需为所做过的事背负什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were kids. I mean, there was nothing that we could do to deserve...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.22,0:48:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just shut up, Evan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.51,0:48:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你在白费口舌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting your breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.64,0:48:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能因为你父亲扭曲变态而怨恨你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hate yourself 'cause your dad's a twisted freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.60,0:48:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说服谁 埃文？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you trying to convince, Evan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.47,0:48:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你大老远跑回来扰乱我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come all the way back here to stir up my shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.69,0:48:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你不好的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}just because you have a bad memory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.02,0:48:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要的就是让我靠在你的肩上哭泣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, do you want me to just cry on your shoulder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.61,0:48:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,然后对你说现在一切都很好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell you everything's all better now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.99,0:48:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧 埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, fuck you, Evan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.24,0:48:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的事情都没变好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's all better, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.78,0:48:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的事情永远都不会变好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing ever gets better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.45,0:48:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 如果我真的那么完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if I was so wonderful, Evan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.21,0:48:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不打电话给我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}why didn't you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.13,0:48:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么把我留在这里任其腐烂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you just leave me here to rot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.77,0:49:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当他像你这么大时... 就开始想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he was your age... almost exactly your age, come to think of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.32,0:49:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他有办法找回以前的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}he said he figured out a way to remember his past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.03,0:49:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有个家伙给你留了口信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some dude left a message for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.38,0:49:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么闻起来全是卫生间的味道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can smell that all the way to the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.46,0:49:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 埃文 我是卡特教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Evan, this is Professor Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.08,0:49:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道你今天下午为什么没有交论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wondered why you didn't hand in your essay this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.07,0:49:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我很担心 给我打电话 告诉我你什么时间能补上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a bit concerned. Call me to schedule a make-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.59,0:49:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的对我姐姐说了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you say to my sister, motherfucker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.05,0:49:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她昨天晚上在电话上跟我哭了一个多小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night she cried on the phone for over an hour to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.22,0:49:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她告诉我你去见过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said you came and saw her last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.36,0:49:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.14,0:49:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她今天晚上自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}she fucking killed herself tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.15,0:49:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.23,0:49:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so are you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.00,0:50:54.01,Default,,0,0,8,,(我会回来找你的)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.06,0:51:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"如果我肚子上的伤疤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If the scar on my stomach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.15,0:51:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不是凭空出现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}didn't just come out of nowhere,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.32,0:51:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我父亲并不像大家所认为的那样是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe my father wasn't as crazy as everyone thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.25,0:51:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能制造伤疤 那我有能力治愈伤疤吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can make scars, do I have the power to heal them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.54,0:51:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那凯丽的伤疤又当如何呢？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Kayleigh's scars?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.42,0:51:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"反正我不想参加那部电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I never wanted to be in the movie, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.67,0:51:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天有些冷 我想穿上衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was cold, so I wanted to wear my clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.09,0:51:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可是米勒先生却把我的衬衫脱掉"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Mr. Miller took my shirt off."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.38,0:52:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个主意 让我们到地下室去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got an idea. Let's go down to the basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.61,0:52:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那里更像个地牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll look more like a dungeon down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.95,0:52:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 开点灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little light here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.04,0:52:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.99,0:52:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我不是告诉过你把门关上吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, now what did I tell you about keeping that door shut?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.84,0:52:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我想看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wanna see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.50,0:52:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,给你两秒钟 按我说的去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to see the back of my fist in about two seconds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.17,0:52:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不然就揍你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you don't do what I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.09,0:52:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这部分的故事是这样的:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, in this part of the story,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.80,0:52:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,罗宾汉刚刚与玛丽安小姐结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robin Hood has just married Maid Marian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.27,0:52:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们得接吻 还有诸如此类的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they have to kiss and stuff,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.52,0:52:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就像大人那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the grown-ups do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.65,0:52:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 衣服脱掉 凯丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, take off your clothes, Kayleigh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.57,0:52:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快点啊就像洗澡时那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, just like when we take a bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.20,0:52:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别大惊小怪的 你也脱 埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make a big deal out of it. You too, Evan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.24,0:52:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 我们在这里拍电影呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go. Let's go. We're making a movie here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.08,0:52:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的耳朵捂上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands on your ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.92,0:53:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现在几点了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.50,0:53:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是你该按我说的话去做的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for you to do what I tell you to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.93,0:53:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,回答错误 老色鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong answer, fuckbag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.05,0:53:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是你认真算计的关键时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the very moment of your reckoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.89,0:53:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来的30秒内 你必须做个选择:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the next 30 seconds, you're going to open up one of two doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.14,0:53:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,第一 你会终身伤害你的亲身骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first door will forever traumatise your own flesh and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.85,0:53:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What... what's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.65,0:53:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会这么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.94,0:53:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它会把你的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll change your daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.19,0:53:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,从一个美丽女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a beautiful child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.15,0:53:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,变成一具行尸走肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}into an empty shell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.50,0:53:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她唯一的信任感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose only concept of trust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.45,0:53:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,被她变态恋童癖的亲生父亲背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}was betrayed by her own sick paedophile father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.95,0:53:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,最终\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ultimately...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.91,0:53:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,导致她自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll lead to her suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.73,0:53:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得真漂亮老爹 - 你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice work, Daddy. - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.42,0:53:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了天理昭彰 乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say you're being closely watched, George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.09,0:53:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,另外一个选择呢 就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your other option is to treat Kayleigh like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.64,0:53:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,当个有爱心的父亲对待凯丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}say like a loving father treats his daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.05,0:53:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来不错吧 老爹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound okay to you, Papa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.67,0:53:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.35,0:54:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细听我说 老色鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen close then, fuckbag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.65,0:54:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是再这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You screw this up again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.02,0:54:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓我要把你阉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll flat out castrate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.54,0:54:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做的就是管好你儿子汤米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you need to do is discipline your son Tommy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.67,0:54:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他是个虐待狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the kid is one sadistic pup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.53,0:54:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One last thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.66,0:54:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,永远别再碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ever touch me again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.38,0:54:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.86,0:54:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahhh!{\r}
