Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.81,1:38:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 我想过很多事情 埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a lot of things have crossed my mind, Ev.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.61,1:38:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说一秒钟就可以想完我们的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I could play out the entire movie of our lives in one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.11,1:38:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嘣 恋爱 结婚 生子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom, we fall in love. We get married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.15,1:39:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子长大 我们变老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have kids. Our kids grow old, as do we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.03,1:39:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,准备葬礼... 诸如此类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matching burial plots. The whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.08,1:39:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,想象比说来得快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plah, it took a lot longer to spit out than to imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.13,1:39:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,事情往往都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things like that usually do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.71,1:39:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.55,1:39:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我们有可能吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you think that it might have worked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.63,1:39:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.76,1:39:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可是最终结果却不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, but that's not how things wound up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.35,1:39:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在跟兰尼在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with Lenny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.60,1:39:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,兰尼是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lenny is your friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.73,1:39:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而且...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.11,1:39:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's where it ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.61,1:39:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,喔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.66,1:39:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是否结局会有所不同 如果我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}would it make a difference if I told you that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.70,1:39:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你的爱世上没有人能比得上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one could possibly ever love anyone as much as I love you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.80,1:40:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你别介意... 说这些... 我... 不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not saying that. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.35,1:40:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我明白 - 我只是说... 我说这些只是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - I'm not... I'm just saying it like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.97,1:40:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是个女孩 你会非常愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you were a girl, would that be something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.14,1:40:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听到这些心里话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you would want to hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.77,1:40:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一会儿 兰尼叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on one second. Lenny's calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.82,1:40:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back, Ev, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.95,1:40:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他情绪有点低落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a little down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.99,1:40:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.35,1:41:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了把脚趾放在水龙头上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot to put the toaster on the ledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.68,1:41:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,兰尼现在生活很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lenny likes Pop Tarts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.97,1:41:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are all that matter now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.60,1:41:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这很艰难 可是你不能放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I know it's hard, but you can't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.40,1:41:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈的连自杀都自杀不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't even fucking kill myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.40,1:41:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你别这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.87,1:41:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把你从这儿弄出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I've got to get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.25,1:42:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,探视时间已经快过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visiting hours are almost over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.76,1:42:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈换了医院了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Mum get transferred again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.22,1:42:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？她一直都在这里啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? She's been here the entire time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.77,1:42:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来... 不错... 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking... good, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.19,1:42:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,肺癌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lung cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.32,1:42:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肺癌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lung cancer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.16,1:42:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我把自己炸伤以后 你就这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You started chain smoking when I blew myself up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.50,1:42:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 他最近很怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Mrs. T, he's been acting out of sorts lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.46,1:42:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想我能修补的 - 修补？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think I could fix this. - Fix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.54,1:42:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要看我写的日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need the journal entry about the blockbuster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.92,1:42:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, no arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.76,1:42:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没写过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never wrote it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.72,1:42:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你的举止和原来不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're... acting... different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.81,1:43:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在是困难时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's just going through tough times right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.06,1:43:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mum...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.02,1:43:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.90,1:43:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以改变这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can change it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.69,1:43:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许应该到礼拜堂去一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, maybe... I wanna go down to the chapel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.07,1:43:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你的... 行为... 跟...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're... acting...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.91,1:43:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.41,1:43:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他在我这个年纪的时候发了疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just 'cause he went crazy when he was my age,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.04,1:43:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不代表我也要发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean I'm gonna go crazy, Mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.83,1:43:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How... did...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.55,1:43:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}you... know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.42,1:43:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.01,1:43:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,家长日 记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}on parent's weekend, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.10,1:43:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.35,1:43:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是 - 是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just... - or you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.61,1:43:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就像詹森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like... Jason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.82,1:43:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't worry, Mum,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.61,1:43:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把你从这儿弄出去的 放心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get you out of here. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.53,1:43:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.37,1:43:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你再也不会疼痛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going to hurt anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.12,1:44:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会挽回一切的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.16,1:44:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.70,1:44:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.92,1:44:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定已经把它们收起来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you even packed it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.46,1:44:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是我妈妈收的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mum packed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.30,1:44:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我让她从家里寄来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she sent everything I ever owned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.47,1:44:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是这本吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.68,1:44:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你找它想做什么？最近总是搞不懂你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want it for? I don't get you lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.84,1:44:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你会明白的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duly noted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.64,1:44:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你要帮我最后一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I have to ask you one last favour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.48,1:44:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 请保持安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I need you to be quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.60,1:44:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我要集中精力毁掉那根雷管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to concentrate if I wanna destroy the blockbuster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.56,1:44:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？大爆炸？- 如果我的手没有在那次爆炸中被炸掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? What, the blockbuster? - If I hadn't blown off my arms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.55,1:44:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈肯定永远不会染上烟瘾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}my mum would've never started smoking in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.70,1:44:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别想了 只管帮我打开日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind. Just open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.74,1:44:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,翻页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.49,1:44:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 就这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.58,1:44:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"今天妈妈会带我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Today Mummy is taking me to play{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.75,1:44:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,与凯丽和汤米玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Kayleigh and Tommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.67,1:44:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我会见到他们的爸爸 看看到底一个真正的爸爸会是什么样"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will meet their father and see what a real dad is like."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.14,1:45:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在要怎么才能毁掉这颗雷管？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, how do I destroy the blockbuster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.74,1:45:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文 你拿那把刀做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan, what are you doing with that knife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.70,1:45:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,唉 这个不行 翻页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that didn't work. Go on, turn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.08,1:45:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,再翻 就这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it. There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.29,1:45:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"反正我不想参加那部电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I never wanted to be in the movie anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.00,1:45:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天有些冷 我想穿上衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was cold so I wanted to wear my clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.55,1:45:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,米勒先生把我的衣服脱掉"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Mr. Miller made me take my shirt off."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.63,1:45:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这部分的故事是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this part of the story,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.47,1:45:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,罗宾汉刚刚与玛丽安小姐结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robin Hood has just married Maid Marian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.18,1:45:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,因而他们得接吻 还有诸如此类的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they have to kiss and stuff,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.73,1:45:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就像成年人那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}like grown-ups do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.39,1:45:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我需要皮带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, I need my belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.32,1:46:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别去管皮带啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't even bother about a belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.20,1:46:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 退后老色鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Back off, fuckbag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.87,1:46:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪你怎么总是留不下一点印象呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing that word never fails to make an impression with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.00,1:46:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该放松 埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy does it, Evan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.58,1:46:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别做个坏孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a bad boy or I'll tell your mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.64,1:46:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我告诉你妈妈说 你是个不听话的小混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}what a naughty little shit you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.71,1:46:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就告诉儿童保护协会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll tell Child Protective Services{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.76,1:46:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里拍儿童色情电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}about your little kiddie porn endeavours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.05,1:46:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你再靠近 我把你的屁股炸烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One step closer and I'll shove this up your arse.{\r}
