Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.08,1:46:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不错嘛 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...good, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.96,1:46:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不送你到圣维尔学院...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got no choice but to commit you to Sunnyvale Institution...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.89,1:46:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文 你要去另外一个地方呆一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to live somewhere else for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.46,1:47:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一只压碎的蝴蝶 - 我想要妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A squashed butterfly. - I want my mummy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.63,1:47:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在受不了这些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sick of this!{\r}
