Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.58,1:47:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的那些该死的书呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are my goddamn books?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.50,1:47:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文 我们应该一个小时后才见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Evan, we're not supposed to meet for another hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.67,1:47:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的那些该死的书呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are my goddamn books?{\r}
