Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.72,1:47:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我的日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My journals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.76,1:47:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我需要它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}L... I need them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.80,1:47:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 把它们给我 它们对我很有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you'd give 'em to me, it'd help a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.85,1:47:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真伤心 你又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It really hurts me to go through this again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.19,1:47:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没有日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no journals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.19,1:47:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,从来就没有过那些日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There never were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.31,1:48:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是你的大脑虚构出来的幻想世界的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's part of the fantasy world that your mind created{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.19,1:48:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,用来克服你内心对误杀凯丽·米勒的内疚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}to cope with the guilt of killing Kayleigh Miller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.65,1:48:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,想想吧 埃文 好好想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think, Evan, think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.74,1:48:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己杜撰了一种根本就不存在的病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've created a disease that does not exist...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.37,1:48:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,交错活在大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}alternate universes with colleges{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.54,1:48:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱和半身不遂的世界里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and prisons and paraplegia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.00,1:48:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我要我的日记 现在就要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my journals and I want 'em now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.04,1:48:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它们在你手里 你必须把它们还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know that you got 'em and you're gonna give 'em to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.05,1:48:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要再骗我了 我需要它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going to hide them from me. I want them!{\r}
