Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.97,1:48:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他总是大声喊叫要那些相簿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was always screaming for a photo album{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.31,1:48:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管那些相簿从来就没有存在过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}even though he never had one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.89,1:48:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.67,1:48:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.40,1:48:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,相簿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A photo album?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.73,1:48:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 相片 - 埃文？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Photos. - Evan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.57,1:48:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,损伤是不可恢复性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The damage is irreparable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.25,1:49:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,坦白地说 我真的感到惊奇 他的多项功能还能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly, I'm surprised he still has use of his motor functions.{\r}
