Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.18,1:49:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 记得把我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, did you remember to bring{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.43,1:49:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,过去拍的家庭电影带来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}those home movies that we used to make?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.69,1:49:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,带来了 就在这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they're right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.06,1:49:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 我真的喜欢看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, because I really like to watch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.99,1:49:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这真的太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.29,1:49:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想最好明天一早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's best we transfer him to Bellevue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.96,1:49:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就转到贝尔坞医院去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}first thing in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.00,1:50:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"如果有人找到这封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If anyone finds this,{\r}
