Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.79,1:50:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,并且我已经死了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm already dead."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.89,1:50:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在自己的房间里 仔细搜查整个一楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not in his room. Search the grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.89,1:50:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"如果我能以某种方式... 回到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If I can somehow go back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.23,1:50:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所有这一切的... 开端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the beginning of all of this...{\r}
