Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.84,1:50:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.14,1:50:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,去那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.29,1:50:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.94,1:51:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,詹森 别拍啦 我快生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to have a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.43,1:51:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.47,1:51:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}AH...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.40,1:51:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有点不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.07,1:51:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,疼死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's killing me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.78,1:51:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,让他停下来 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it stop! Oh!{\r}
