Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.45,1:51:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.62,1:51:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有生命线 没有灵魂 你根本就不该来到这个世上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no lifeline, no soul. You were never meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.42,1:51:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他快窒息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's choking himself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.96,1:51:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.75,1:51:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们给她做剖腹产 准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's do a rapid sequence intubation for a c-section, stat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.88,1:51:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救救他 - 氧气不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Save him! - Not getting enough oxygen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.42,1:52:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他快不行了不行了 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're losing him, we're losing him! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.55,1:52:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在你出生前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you were born,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.72,1:52:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我怀孕了三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was pregnant three times,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.35,1:52:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们都流产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they were all stillbirths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.73,1:52:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,从那时候开始我认为你是我的奇迹小宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've kind of thought of you as my miracle baby ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.07,1:52:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.65,1:52:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
