Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.91,1:52:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我和我妈妈一起住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I knew that if I went to live with my mum,{\r}
