Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.36,1:52:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,凯丽 汤米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayleigh and Tommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.32,1:53:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.78,1:53:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不会让你们离开我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never let you guys out of my sight again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.51,1:53:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,吔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.97,1:53:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只有做出牺牲才能获得幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}True happiness can only be achieved through sacrifice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.60,1:53:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我们父母一样 他们做出巨大牺牲 我们才有今日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the sacrifices our parents have made, to make us be here today!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.15,1:53:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦 太棒了 汤米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo-hoo! Great! Tommy!{\r}
